ermined value for form field for typical usage, but if failing validation checks on that condition the value can determined by user response on a resubmit. The Override feature allows for both setting defaults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":278092,"global_rank":45545,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6731},{"name":"ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","owner":"ianyepan","html_url":"https://github.com/ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Automatically refreshes the current Bitcoin price and plays \"You Suffer\" by Napalm Death every time it detects a price drop; and plays a cheerful notification whenever the price goes up. (Inspired by HBO series: Silicon Valley)","topics":[],"score":278091,"global_rank":34350,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6732},{"name":"stevekrenzel/advent_of_code","owner":"stevekrenzel","html_url":"https://github.com/stevekrenzel/advent_of_code","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Advent of Code 2021","topics":[],"score":278062,"global_rank":34362,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6733},{"name":"yakuzadave/GPT3_Slack_Integration","owner":"yakuzadave","html_url":"https://github.com/yakuzadave/GPT3_Slack_Integration","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":"A way to make requests to OpenAI GPT-3 using your Slack client for the prompts","topics":[],"score":278035,"global_rank":34379,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6734},{"name":"onecrayon/Kaleidoscope.sugar","owner":"onecrayon","html_url":"https://github.com/onecrayon/Kaleidoscope.sugar","sta